---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="House Cleaning Services Columbia MD | Greenwood Cleaning LLC"
  description="Top-rated house cleaning and maid services in Columbia, Ellicott City, and Howard County, MD. Licensed & Insured residential, deep, and move-in/out cleaning."
>
  <main>
    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="container hero-text">
        <h1>
          <span class="hero-brand">Greenwood Cleaning Services LLC</span>
          <br>Premier House Cleaning Services in Columbia MD
        </h1>
        <p>Proudly serving Columbia, Ellicott City, and all of Howard County with licensed, insured, and detail-oriented maid care.</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn-hero">Get Your Free Estimate</a>
        <p class="hero-subtext"><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i> No Long-Term Contracts &bull; <i class="fas fa-shield-alt"></i> Fully Insured &bull; <i class="fas fa-star"></i> 5-Star Rated</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Local Cleaning Experts Section -->
    <section class="bg-light">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-header">
          <h2>Local Cleaning Experts You Can Trust</h2>
          <p>At <span class="brand-highlight">Greenwood Cleaning Services LLC</span>, we are a locally owned home cleaning business serving the Howard County community with pride, reliability, and the highest standards of cleanliness.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="grid-3">
          <div class="card">
            <div class="icon-box"><i class="fas fa-shield-alt"></i></div>
            <h3>Licensed & Insured LLC</h3>
            <p><span class="brand-highlight">Greenwood Cleaning Services LLC</span> is fully registered in Maryland. We protect your home and our team for total peace of mind.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <div class="icon-box"><i class="fas fa-map-marker-alt"></i></div>
            <h3>Locally Owned in Columbia</h3>
            <p>Based right here in Columbia, MD. The <strong>Greenwood</strong> team knows Howard County neighborhoods, values punctuality, and treats your home like family.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <div class="icon-box"><i class="fas fa-gem"></i></div>
            <h3>100% Satisfaction Guarantee</h3>
            <p>Our detail-oriented residential cleaners guarantee a spotless finish. Experience thorough cleaning standards every single visit.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Professional Cleaning Solutions -->
    <section>
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-header">
          <h2>Our Professional Cleaning Solutions</h2>
          <p>Tailor-made house cleaning and maid services for your home and schedule.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="grid-3">
          <div class="card">
            <div class="icon-box"><i class="fas fa-home"></i></div>
            <h3>Residential Cleaning</h3>
            <p>Weekly, bi-weekly, or monthly recurring maid service to keep your Howard County home consistently fresh and sanitized.</p>
            <a href="/services" class="link-more">View Details &rarr;</a>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <div class="icon-box"><i class="fas fa-box-open"></i></div>
            <h3>Move-In / Move-Out Cleaning</h3>
            <p>Comprehensive move out deep cleaning for tenants, realtors, and homeowners across Maryland. We help secure your security deposit.</p>
            <a href="/services" class="link-more">View Checklist &rarr;</a>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <div class="icon-box"><i class="fas fa-broom"></i></div>
            <h3>Deep House Cleaning</h3>
            <p>A rigorous top-to-bottom scrub perfect for spring cleaning, special events, or first-time intensive visits.</p>
            <a href="/services" class="link-more">Learn More &rarr;</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Reviews Section -->
    <section class="bg-light reviews-section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-header">
          <h2>Trusted by Howard County Homeowners</h2>
          <p>See why families across Columbia and Ellicott City choose Greenwood Cleaning Services LLC.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="grid-3">
          <div class="card review-card">
            <div class="stars">
              <i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i>
            </div>
            <p class="review-text">"Greenwood has been cleaning our Columbia home bi-weekly for months. Always punctual, thorough, and completely trustworthy. The house smells incredible after every visit!"</p>
            <span class="reviewer-name">&mdash; Sarah M., Columbia MD</span>
          </div>
          <div class="card review-card">
            <div class="stars">
              <i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i>
            </div>
            <p class="review-text">"Booked their deep cleaning service before hosting family for the holidays in Ellicott City. Baseboards, kitchen, bathrooms, everything was spotless. Highly recommended!"</p>
            <span class="reviewer-name">&mdash; David T., Ellicott City MD</span>
          </div>
          <div class="card review-card">
            <div class="stars">
              <i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i>
            </div>
            <p class="review-text">"Outstanding move-out cleaning in Clarksville. Our landlord returned 100% of our deposit without hesitation. True professionals from start to finish."</p>
            <span class="reviewer-name">&mdash; Karen R., Clarksville MD</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Areas Section -->
    <section class="areas-section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-header">
          <h2>Proudly Serving Howard County & Beyond</h2>
          <p>We bring our professional cleaning services to doorsteps across central Maryland.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="area-grid-container">
          <div class="area-column">
            <h3>Central Howard County</h3>
            <ul class="area-list">
              <li>Columbia (All Villages)</li>
              <li>Ellicott City</li>
              <li>Clarksville</li>
              <li>Fulton</li>
              <li>Highland</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="area-column">
            <h3>East & South Corridor</h3>
            <ul class="area-list">
              <li>North Laurel</li>
              <li>Savage</li>
              <li>Jessup</li>
              <li>Elkridge</li>
              <li>Hanover</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="area-column">
            <h3>Western & Rural Areas</h3>
            <ul class="area-list">
              <li>Glenelg</li>
              <li>Dayton</li>
              <li>Lisbon</li>
              <li>West Friendship</li>
              <li>Marriottsville / Woodstock</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="area-column">
            <h3>Extended Service Areas</h3>
            <ul class="area-list">
              <li>Silver Spring (Montgomery Co.)</li>
              <li>Catonsville</li>
              <li>South Baltimore</li>
              <li>Laurel (Prince George's Co.)</li>
              <li>Olney / Ashton</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p style="text-align: center; margin-top: 40px; font-size: 0.95rem;">
          Don't see your specific town listed? <br>
          <span class="brand-highlight">Greenwood Cleaning Services LLC</span> likely serves it! 
          <a href="/contact" style="color: var(--dark-text); font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline;">Contact us to confirm coverage.</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>

